{"title":"Friday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/918027824/0/marginalrevolution~Friday-assorted-links.html","date":1746806181000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.strangeloopcanon.com/p/working-with-llms-a-few-lessons?r=3algm&amp;utm_medium=ios&amp;triedRedirect=true\" target=\"_blank\">Rohit on working with LLMs</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.22828\" target=\"_blank\">Learning to reason for long-form story generation</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/jackclarkSF/status/1920168529506025705\" target=\"_blank\">Anthropic looking to hire economic wisdom</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/patrickc/status/1920449332773355799\" target=\"_blank\">“We’re [Stripe] partnering with Ramp to launch stablecoin-backed cards, first in Latin America.”</a></p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/jasonahart/status/1919373460129636713\" target=\"_blank\">Philanthropy to ponder</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2025/05/08/world/europe/agatha-christie-ai-class-bbc.html\" target=\"_blank\">AI Agatha Christie is teaching an online writing course</a> (NYT).  The family is on board.</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.piie.com/sites/default/files/2025-05/wp25-8.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Olivier Blanchard on convergence in macroeconomics</a>.  I read this all as “we still do not understand very much” perhaps more than he intended?</p>\r\n<p>8. “<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/davidsacks47/status/1920543150449569992?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag\" target=\"_blank\">The Trump administration has announced its intention to repeal the Biden administration’s AI Diffusion Rule.</a>”  Important.</p>\r\n<p>9. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.theartnewspaper.com/2025/05/08/robert-francis-prevost-has-been-elected-pope-leo-xivwhy-does-this-matter-to-the-worlds-of-art-and-heritage?utm_source=The+Art+Newspaper+Newsletters&amp;utm_campaign=698e4dd78f-EMAIL_CAMPAIGN_2025_05_05_02_59_COPY_01&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_-69c439655a-62240358\" target=\"_blank\">The Pope as art custodian</a>.</p>\r\n<p>10. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2025-05-09/uk-trade-deal-best-part-isn-t-about-tariffs?taid=681dd34e79cfff00010eaaac&amp;utm_campaign=trueanthem&amp;utm_content=business&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_source=twitter&amp;sref=htOHjx5Y\" target=\"_blank\">Non-tariff barriers in the US-UK trade deal</a> (Bloomberg).  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://capx.co/how-good-is-the-us-uk-trade-deal\" target=\"_blank\">one British perspective</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/friday-assorted-links-520.html\">Friday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/918027824/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/918027824/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/918027824/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/918027824/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"